{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.poster.avif?t=1773968844\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.webm?t=1773968844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.mp4?t=1773968844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr Investigator</strong> is a <strong>time-traveling detective puzzler</strong> that will have you string together  through <strong>grit</strong> and <strong>clever deductions</strong>, the cumulating  series of events leading into an unresolved <strong>murder</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve an interconnected timeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence and extrapolate what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece it back together using your own detective thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal handholding, eureka moments are entirely yours to own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your next case Mr Investigator. That's what she called you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's business as usual at The Time Bureau. Another misfortune filed on our doorstep. Difference this time was how particular she felt about handing us the work. It's to do with her father, mind you. She even left a note behind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want my advice, do what you've always done.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1773968844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1773968844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/7b9d6b75c3771489801a8dbcd59cf1fbb7c1a079/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773968844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/7b9d6b75c3771489801a8dbcd59cf1fbb7c1a079/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773968844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General Mature Content. Contains stylized depictions of violence and investigation themes. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.poster.avif?t=1773968844\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.webm?t=1773968844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.mp4?t=1773968844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr Investigator</strong> is a <strong>time-traveling detective puzzler</strong> that will have you string together  through <strong>grit</strong> and <strong>clever deductions</strong>, the cumulating  series of events leading into an unresolved <strong>murder</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve an interconnected timeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather evidence and extrapolate what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece it back together using your own detective thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal handholding, eureka moments are entirely yours to own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your next case Mr Investigator. That's what she called you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's business as usual at The Time Bureau. Another misfortune filed on our doorstep. Difference this time was how particular she felt about handing us the work. It's to do with her father, mind you. She even left a note behind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want my advice, do what you've always done.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Haoning Wu"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/1ed4a4048fa2ab2d38d27a4c88550ff7491365a6/header.jpg?t=1773968844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816830/24070904/bb6b0f48fcba6b4ea7738b35759f71ae072e2597/1768137951/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768138644","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816830/24070904/bb6b0f48fcba6b4ea7738b35759f71ae072e2597/1768137951/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768138644","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816830/24070904/bb6b0f48fcba6b4ea7738b35759f71ae072e2597/1768137951/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768138644","id":257263113,"name":"Mr Investigator","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263113/085f7c93b1ed12bbac69b37ee4d472d74e